WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:05,420
Bai Xuan Chong

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,980
A street of attributeless spiritual beasts

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:10,100
The adult form will have different branches depending on how it is cultured.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,100
The adult worms will lay eggs into the body of the spirit beast

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,900
Absorb the spiritual power of the parasitic beast

6
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:16,060
Only when you reduce and transform can you climb out.

7
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:18,890
Bai Xuan Chong

8
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:21,210
Isn't that an insect the size of a finger?

9
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:23,690
And only Bai Xuan Chong Sanjie will vomit to death

10
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,250
Isn't the person you contracted with already Sanjie?

11
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,250
this little guy

12
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,130
Probably because the eggs were laid in the elixir

13
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:31,330
He almost sucked in the entire Fourth Street Elixir with one insect

14
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,530
No wonder it's so good

15
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,250
Senior sister didn't mean it

16
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:42,320
Can you clean the silk on senior sister's face?

17
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:45,880
Is this retribution for laughing at Junior Brother Chu?

18
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:49,040
There are less than three days until the duel with Monkey Three.

19
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,120
This way you hold it

20
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,700
Just apply it to the wound two or three times and it will be healed

21
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:59,630
Thank you, senior sister

22
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:01,350
This duel is about you and me

23
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:02,670
You restore the potion as soon as possible

24
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:05,230
And I believe that Junior Brother Chu is not something that lasts forever.

25
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:06,350
Waiting for you to develop in the future

26
00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:07,750
Don't forget it
